      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aStellar Forge / Stellar Forge : Alloy Smelter§r\n\nMere mortals can't even begin to understand the progress we've made.\nEnslaving Stellaris to work for us.\nNo matter how large the workload, it can be done in one time.\nNo matter how large the workload, it need one Critical Photon to start.\nPower consumption: Alloy Smelter 100% | Stellar Forge 200%\nDirectly get EU from the Wireless EU Net.\nWarning! If trying to start machine when Wireless EU Net has not enough EU,\nthe materials will fade.\nPut Integrated Circuit into Controller block to decrease process time interval.\n\n[note]Structure[/note]: Space Elevator casings; the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembly Line, UXV\nResearch item: eM Teleportation\n - 256x Mega Alloy Blast Smelter\n - 64x Stellar Construction Frame Material\n - 64x Emitter UMV\n - 64x Field Generator UMV\n - 64x EM Teleportation\n - 128x High Energy Flow Circuit\n - 128x UXV Circuit\n - 64x Space Warper\n - 64x Gravitational Lens\n - 64x Particle Trap Time Space Shield\n - 64x Energised Tesseract\n - 9,437,184 L Solder plasma\n - 65,536,000 L UU Matter\n - 16,384,000x Excited DTEC",
